<title>USA: Wave Technologies to develop training.</title>
<headline>Wave Technologies to develop training.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wave Technologies International Inc said Wednesday it was selected by Legato Systems Inc to develop instructor-led courses for its new Windows NT products.</p>
<p>Wave said it would also update three existing Legato courses.</p>
<p>Legato Systems markets and supports network storage management software products. Wave develops training and instructional products related to information technologies.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
